From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:49:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2741/3799] soh: rename func_8002DDA8 ->
 Player_IsCarryingOrAiming

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: true while carrying an actor or aiming a held item; the same unnamed field limits how firm the second half of the name can be
Defined in soh/src/code/z_actor.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_actor.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
index c7802ef62..182045df0 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
@@ -1431,7 +1431,8 @@ s32 Player_IsAimingHeldItem(Player* player) {
     return Player_HasItemInHand(player) && player->unk_834;  // was func_8002DD6C [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
-s32 func_8002DDA8(PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_8002DDA8: true while carrying an actor or aiming a held item; the same unnamed field limits how firm the second half of the name can be
+s32 Player_IsCarryingOrAiming(PlayState* play) {
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
 
     return (player->stateFlags1 & PLAYER_STATE1_CARRYING_ACTOR) || Player_IsAimingHeldItem(player);  // was func_8002DD78 [LLM:GUESS]
